# Test the Cover Type API (PyCharm HTTP Client)
# Start the server first:  uvicorn backend.main:app --reload

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### Model info (architecture, classes, feature stats, test metrics)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/model-info
Accept: application/json

### One representative test-set row per class
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/examples
Accept: application/json

### Predict — full 54-feature payload (first dataset row, true label: Aspen)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Elevation": 2596,
  "Aspect": 51,
  "Slope": 3,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology": 258,
  "Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology": 0,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways": 510,
