### Predict — sparse payload (one-hot fields default to 0)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Elevation": 3350,
  "Aspect": 110,
  "Slope": 16,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology": 330,
  "Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology": 60,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways": 2500,
  "Hillshade_9am": 225,
  "Hillshade_Noon": 220,
  "Hillshade_3pm": 128,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points": 2000,
  "Wilderness_Area_2": 1,
  "Soil_Type_37": 1
}

### Batch prediction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instances": [
    {
      "Elevation": 2596, "Aspect": 51, "Slope": 3,
      "Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology": 258, "Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology": 0,
      "Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways": 510, "Hillshade_9am": 221, "Hillshade_Noon": 232,
      "Hillshade_3pm": 148, "Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points": 6279,
      "Wilderness_Area_0": 1, "Soil_Type_28": 1
    },
    {
      "Elevation": 3350, "Aspect": 110, "Slope": 16,
      "Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology": 330, "Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology": 60,
      "Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways": 2500, "Hillshade_9am": 225, "Hillshade_Noon": 220,
      "Hillshade_3pm": 128, "Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points": 2000,
      "Wilderness_Area_2": 1, "Soil_Type_37": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Validation error — two soil types active (expect 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Elevation": 2596, "Aspect": 51, "Slope": 3,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology": 258, "Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology": 0,
  "Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways": 510, "Hillshade_9am": 221, "Hillshade_Noon": 232,
  "Hillshade_3pm": 148, "Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points": 6279,
  "Wilderness_Area_0": 1, "Soil_Type_28": 1, "Soil_Type_3": 1
}
